_status": "full_text_accessed", "original_selection_status": null, "selection_status": "selected_checkpoint_priority_work", "source_record_ids": ["PAPER-ACF64-BD-L2"]}','The proof of the $l^2$ Decoupling Conjecture','["Jean Bourgain", "Ciprian Demeter"]',NULL,'2014',0,0,'selected_checkpoint_priority_work','full_text_accessed','arXiv:1403.5335v3','https://arxiv.org/pdf/1403.5335v3','d4240e5d8f6d42e7e0085241dd2de7b0e896a9546e1f7eba87cf376186d0a2f5','papers/analytic64_crossfield_methods_notes.md','papers/analytic64_crossfield_methods_records.jsonl');
