d_path": "papers/PAPER-D202.md", "track_file": "papers/spectral_extension_round2_records.jsonl", "original_selection_status": "Deferred pending full-text access; modern source PAPER-D201 read instead.", "source_record_ids": ["PAPER-D202"]}','An interlacing theorem for eigenvalues of self-adjoint operators','["Jerome Dancis", "Chandler Davis"]','["D", "H"]','1987',0,0,'deferred_supporting_bibliographic_record','unknown','Original journal identity; full text not obtained','https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/0024379587901066',NULL,'papers/PAPER-D202.md','papers/spectral_extension_round2_records.jsonl');
