_records.jsonl", "original_selection_status": null, "selection_status": "selected_checkpoint_priority_work", "source_record_ids": ["PAPER-SM63-COMP-006"]}','On the Zeros of the Riemann Zeta Function in the Critical Strip. IV','["Jan van de Lune", "Herman J. J. te Riele", "Dik T. Winter"]',NULL,'1986',0,0,'selected_checkpoint_priority_work','full_text_accessed','primary journal, conference, or author-hosted working copy','https://ir.cwi.nl/pub/1808/1808D.pdf','3c48d6e776b9cb53e2fd22fb1f26e1eecd70f0883549d9fb787ea7ea64e1c4b9','papers/suzuki_model63_computational_notes.md','papers/suzuki_model63_computational_records.jsonl');
